(Bloomberg) -- Goldman Sachs Group Inc. this week became the latest major Wall Street firm to file for a Bitcoin ETF — joining Morgan Stanley, BlackRock Inc. and a growing roster of institutions racing to package cryptocurrencies for mainstream investors.&nbsp;

